{"route":"/hop/wiki/perks/exposed","title":"Exposed Hand - House of Pips Wiki","description":"Exposed Hand (Malus) in House of Pips: The award from your remaining hand increases by 25 percent.","html":"<p class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks\">Perks</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks#malus\">Malus</a></p>\n<article class=\"entry rarity-malus\" id=\"perk-exposed\">\n<header class=\"entry-head\">\n<img class=\"entry-icon\" src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/exposed-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\">\n<div><h1>Exposed Hand</h1><p class=\"entry-sub\">Malus &middot; Hand award penalty</p></div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"entry-body\">\n<div class=\"entry-main\">\n<blockquote class=\"card-text\"><p>The award from your remaining hand increases by 25 percent.</p><footer>In-game card text</footer></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"how-it-works\">How it works</h2>\n<p><strong>Malus.</strong> When you lose a hand, the award from your remaining bones goes up <strong>25% for each copy</strong> (copies compound: two copies are ×1.5625), rounded up.</p>\n<ul><li>It applies last, after <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/fortress\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/fortress-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Bone Fortress</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/soft_landing\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/soft_landing-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Soft Landing</a> and <a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/heavy_hand\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/heavy_hand-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Heavy Hand</a>. The award is then rounded up to a multiple of five.</li><li><a class=\"ref rarity-legendary\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/immunity\" title=\"Legendary perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/immunity-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Untouchable Hand</a> cancels it, and <a class=\"ref ref-skill\" href=\"/hop/wiki/skills#malus_ward\" title=\"Skill tree: House Rules\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/skills/malus_ward-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Malus Ward</a> can block it.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"at-a-glance\">At a glance</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"facts\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Rarity</th><td><span class=\"pill rarity-malus\">Malus</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Type</th><td>Hand award penalty</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">How to get it</th><td>Never bought. A Malus card is dealt into every standard draft.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"entry-card\"><a href=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/exposed-card.png\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/exposed-card.png\" alt=\"The Exposed Hand card as drawn in the game\" width=\"468\" height=\"498\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The card as it appears in a draft.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</article>\n<nav class=\"pager\" aria-label=\"Neighbouring perks\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/tax\">&larr; Perk Tax</a><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/stumble\">Stumble &rarr;</a></nav>","toc":[]}